      ],
      "budget_share": 0.20,
      "why": "unrolled_k produces one result every ceil(N/k)+3 cycles, so it can only reach 50 MSPS if Fmax is very high (k*Fmax >= 50e6). It is a lower-FF, lower-area datapath than pipelined, so it may win on power_index if the Fmax headroom exists. I include it with a small share to confirm whether it is feasible at all and to capture any low-power point on the front; k is pushed high (4-8) to maximise results/cycle."
    }
